          {
            "title": "Find a Course Lesson",
            "id": 152252,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kurs może zawierać wiele lekcji, więc jedna wartość ścieżki identyfikuje kurs, a inna identyfikuje jego lekcje.</p><p>Zagnieżdżone trasy przechowują obie wartości obok zasobów, które identyfikują.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"import\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" requests\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"course = \" /><text value=\"12\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"lesson = \" /><text value=\"4\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"url = \" /><text value=\"f&quot;https://mimo.org/courses/\" /><text value=\"{course}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"/lessons/\" /><text value=\"{lesson}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"&quot;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"response = requests.get(url)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"data = response.json()\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(data)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  &quot;id&quot;: 4,\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  &quot;title&quot;: &quot;Working with APIs&quot;,\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  &quot;course_id&quot;: 12\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></output></code></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Add the Course ID",
            "id": 152253,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Każdy parametr trasy ma określoną pozycję w adresie URL na podstawie zasobu, który identyfikuje.</p><p>Dodaj identyfikator kursu po <code>/courses</code> i identyfikator lekcji po <code>/lessons</code> w adresie URL.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"import\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" requests\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"course = \" /><text value=\"12\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"lesson = \" /><text value=\"4\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"url = \" /><text value=\"f&quot;https://mimo.org/courses/\" /><text value=\"{course}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"/lessons/\" /><text value=\"{lesson}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"&quot;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"response = requests.get(url)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"data = response.json()\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(data)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"17\" endIndex=\"23\" /><option startIndex=\"29\" endIndex=\"35\" /><option startIndex=\"74\" endIndex=\"80\" /><option startIndex=\"91\" endIndex=\"97\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  &quot;id&quot;: 4,\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  &quot;title&quot;: &quot;Working with APIs&quot;,\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  &quot;course_id&quot;: 12\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>course</code>, następnie <code>lesson</code>, a potem <code>course</code>, <code>lesson</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Każdy parametr trasy ma określoną pozycję w adresie URL na podstawie zasobu, który identyfikuje.</p><p>Zapisz <code>12</code> w <code>course</code>, a <code>4</code> w <code>lesson</code>. Pobierz tę lekcję z tego kursu.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"import\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" requests\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"course = \" /><text value=\"12\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"lesson = \" /><text value=\"4\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"url = \" /><text value=\"f&quot;https://mimo.org/courses/\" /><text value=\"{course}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"/lessons/\" /><text value=\"{lesson}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"&quot;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"response = requests.get(url)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"data = response.json()\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(data)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"17\" endIndex=\"23\" /><option startIndex=\"29\" endIndex=\"35\" /><option startIndex=\"74\" endIndex=\"80\" /><option startIndex=\"91\" endIndex=\"97\" /><option startIndex=\"121\" endIndex=\"124\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"post\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"data\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  &quot;id&quot;: 4,\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  &quot;title&quot;: &quot;Working with APIs&quot;,\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  &quot;course_id&quot;: 12\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>course</code>, następnie <code>lesson</code>, <code>course</code>, <code>lesson</code> i na końcu <code>get</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Add the Nested Resource",
            "id": 152254,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Nazwa zagnieżdżonego zasobu jest zgodna z wartością kursu.</p><p>Uzupełnij kod, aby upewnić się, że liczba <code>12</code> jest używana jako identyfikator kursu, a liczba <code>4</code> jako identyfikator lekcji w adresie URL.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"import\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" requests\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"course = \" /><text value=\"12\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"lesson = \" /><text value=\"4\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"url = \" /><text value=\"f&quot;https://mimo.org/courses/\" /><text value=\"{course}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"/lessons/\" /><text value=\"{lesson}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"&quot;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"response = requests.get(url)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"data = response.json()\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(data)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"65\" endIndex=\"72\" /><option startIndex=\"82\" endIndex=\"89\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  &quot;id&quot;: 4,\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  &quot;title&quot;: &quot;Working with APIs&quot;,\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  &quot;course_id&quot;: 12\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>courses</code>, a następnie <code>lessons</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Nazwa zagnieżdżonego zasobu jest zgodna z wartością kursu.</p><p>Uzupełnij kod, aby upewnić się, że liczba <code>12</code> jest używana jako identyfikator kursu, a liczba <code>4</code> jako identyfikator lekcji w adresie URL.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"import\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" requests\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"course = \" /><text value=\"12\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"lesson = \" /><text value=\"4\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"url = \" /><text value=\"f&quot;https://mimo.org/courses/\" /><text value=\"{course}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"/lessons/\" /><text value=\"{lesson}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"&quot;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"response = requests.get(url)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"data = response.json()\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(data)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"65\" endIndex=\"72\" /><option startIndex=\"74\" endIndex=\"80\" /><option startIndex=\"82\" endIndex=\"89\" /><option startIndex=\"91\" endIndex=\"97\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"users\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"certificates\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  &quot;id&quot;: 4,\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  &quot;title&quot;: &quot;Working with APIs&quot;,\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  &quot;course_id&quot;: 12\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>courses</code>, następnie <code>course</code>, <code>lessons</code> i na końcu <code>lesson</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
